= Abram Gots

Gots (1882-1940), a Right Centre leader, is chairman of the Soviet executive. He holds the Menshevik-SR bloc together, and is an old combat organiser.

- @action
- @root: Return to main

@action
title: Soviet Majority
subtitle: Gots votes the SR delegations together with the Mensheviks.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before the next advisor action. ?]
on-arrival: {!
Q.advisor_action_timer = 6;
Q.last_advisor_action = 1;
Q.month_actions += 1;
RO.add(Q, {rel_ally: 6, soviet_democracy: 1}); RO.boost(Q, {workers: 2, soldiers: 3, railway: 2}); RO.fac(Q, 'unions', 1, -1);
!}

Gots met Dan and Tsereteli before every session, and the two delegations voted as one. The Bolsheviks call it the Menshevik-SR gang.

